<title>EGYPT: EGYPT BANK SIX MONTH RESULTS.</title>
<headline>EGYPT BANK SIX MONTH RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first six months of the 1997 calendar year, the bank's financial year.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds):</p>
<p>				 30JUNE1997    30JUNE1996</p>
<p>Total deposits	1,386,073,000	756,598,000</p>
<p>Total assets	  1,875,047,000	974,232,000</p>
<p>Reserves		   14,751,000	 13,427,000</p>
<p>Provisions		 84,919,000	 63,338,000</p>
<p>Shareholders funds    156,013,000	 95,965,000</p>
<p>Net profits		18,530,000	  9,236,000</p>
<p>Full name is Egyptian Gulf Bank.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
